{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Return Value","type":"heading","anchor":"return-value","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If the state machine got to the state. It is false if the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"state machine can no longer get there, or the task was cancelled.","type":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It returns at once if the state machine is already at the state."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Otherwise it waits for a transition leading to the state. A state"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entered and left again before the waiting task runs still counts,"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so read ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"state"},{"text":" to know where the state machine is by then.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The waiting ends without the state being reached when the state"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"machine gets to a state from which the state can no longer be reached,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"like an ending state, and when the task waiting is cancelled."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Like a stream, it only knows the transitions made after it was"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"called. A state entered and left again before the call is missed,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which can happen when it is called from a new task, as the task can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"start running after the events were processed. A state the state"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"machine stays at, like an ending state, is never missed."}]},{"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing","code":["Task {","    if await stateMachine.wait(for: .delivered) {","        print(\"Delivered\")","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A task waiting keeps the state machine. For a state machine without"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ending states, cancel the task when the state is no longer of interest."}]}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine\/wait(for:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://MiamiStateMachine/documentation/MiamiStateMachine/StateMachine/wait(for:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Waits until the state machine is at a state."}],"url":"\/documentation\/miamistatemachine\/statemachine\/wait(for:)","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"wait(for:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"wait"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"for"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C0B0q_mfp","text":"State"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine\/wait(for:)"},"doc://MiamiStateMachine/documentation/MiamiStateMachine":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"MiamiStateMachine","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/miamistatemachine"},"doc://MiamiStateMachine/documentation/MiamiStateMachine/StateMachine":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"StateMachine","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A state machine is an actor with a current state and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a set 